rl":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-27T17:20:11Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T17:22:21Z","body":"It's an issue with selecting system emoji font, not a rendering issue. Android do not have proper API for system getting font info, so font selecting is unreliable. In this case, seems like it's selecting `/system/fonts/NotoColorEmojiLegacy.ttf` since it's in the android font manifest, but for some reason the file do not exist.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2688616451/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2688664952","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103363#issuecomment-2688664952","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103363","id":2688664952,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gQcV4","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-27T17:40:58Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T17:42:20Z","body":"And the only other emoji font on Android is `CPAL/COLR` format font, which is not supported by Godot (only supports `PNG` and `SVG` emoji fonts). So you'll need to include a custom emoji font to the project to use emoji, which is a good idea in general for all platforms (iOS system emoji font use proprietary format and also not usable, macOS and Windows fonts usually are working, Web can't access system fonts at all).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2688664952/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2688679825","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103363#issuecomment-2688679825","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103363","id":2688679825,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gQf-R","user":{"login":"oxixxixo","id":61514710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNTE0NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61514710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxixxixo","html_url":"https://github.com/oxixxixo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxixxixo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxixxixo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxixxixo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":