vice's screen.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698455111/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3048911011","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103363#issuecomment-3048911011","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103363","id":3048911011,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61urCj","user":{"login":"maran","id":20855,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20855?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran","html_url":"https://github.com/maran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-08T13:11:00Z","updated_at":"2025-07-08T13:11:00Z","body":"I checked the fonts and got: \"NotoColorEmoji.ttf\", \"NotoColorEmojiFlags.ttf\". But not he legacy one. \n\nWhat can I do to get Emoji back working on newer Android versions? I can download Noto Color but how can I ensure Android knows how to use this with my gradle build? ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3048911011/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3049787034","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103363#issuecomment-3049787034","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103363","id":3049787034,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61yA6a","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-08T17:40:04Z","updated_at":"2025-07-08T17:40:04Z","body":"> What can I do to get Emoji back working on newer Android versions? I can download Noto Color but how can I ensure Android knows how to use this with my gradle build?\n\nInclude the font file somewhere in your project, and specify it as a [font fallback](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.html#doc-using-fonts-font-fallbacks) for your custom font that you use in your various Control nodes (or as a default project font).\n\nTo clarify, you should **not** make `NotoColorEmoji.ttf` your default project font, but it should be a font fallback of your default project font.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3049787034/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]